mək istəsəniz)","submit":"Rəy göndərin","success":"təşəkkür edirəm. Rəyiniz göndərildi.","disclaimer":"Zəhmət olmasa həssas şəxsi məlumatları daxil etməyin. E-poçt isteğe bağlıdır və yalnız cavab verməli olduğumuz halda istifadə olunur.","iframeTitle":"Əlaqənin təqdim edilməsi"},"contactPage":{"title":"Contact Us","intro":"The fastest way to reach us is email:","topicsTitle":"What we're happy to hear about","requestsTitle":"Puzzle requests.","requests":"Tell us a theme your child or class loves and the rough age range — requests genuinely shape what we publish next.","correctionsTitle":"Corrections.","corrections":"A misnumbered dot, a printing problem, a translation that reads oddly — report it and we will fix the page.","licensingTitle":"Classroom and licensing questions.","licensing":"Personal and classroom printing is already free. For anything beyond that — republishing, bundling, or commercial use — ask first.","licensingNote":"(see our <link>terms of use</link>).","feedbackTitle":"Feedback.","feedback":"What works, what doesn't, what you would like more of.","responseTitle":"Response time","response":"This is a small operation, so replies can take a few days. Correction reports get priority.","aboutPrefix":"More about the site and who makes it:","aboutLink":"about us"},"puzzleDetail":{"agesLabel":"Ages:","dotsLabel":"Dots:","freeLabel":"100% Free","difficultyHeading":"Difficulty","difficultyEasy":"Easy","difficultyMedium":"Medium","difficultyHard":"Hard","funFactPrefix":"Fun fact:","funFactLabel":"Fun fact!","noSignUp":"No sign-up needed. Opens as a PDF. Print on US Letter (8.5 × 11 inch) or A4 paper. Free for home and classroom use.","comingSoon":"Download Free PDF – Coming Soon","youMightLike":"You might also like","faqQ1":"What age is the {name} dot to dot puzzle for?","faqA1":"It is designed for ages {age}. With {dots} dots, it suits children who can confidently count to {dots}; younger children can complete it with a little help.","faqQ2":"How do I print